Package: qubes-net-widget-netvm
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 python3,
 python3-gi,
 gir1.2-nm-1.0,
 network-manager,
 conntrack,
 iproute2,
 qubes-core-agent-network-manager,
 qubes-core-qrexec,
Description: Network services of the network widget for the network qube
 The qrexec services that report and change Ethernet and Wi-Fi of the
 network qube through NetworkManager, for the network widget of dom0 and
 the GUI domains. Install it only in the template of the network qube.

Package: qubes-net-widget-guivm
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 python3,
 python3-gi,
 gir1.2-gtk-3.0,
 librsvg2-common,
 qubes-core-qrexec,
 qubes-desktop-linux-manager,
Description: Network tray widget for the GUI domains
 Tray widget showing Ethernet and Wi-Fi of the network qube in a GUI
 domain. It starts only where the 'qubes-net-widget' qvm-service is
 enabled and calls the network services through qrexec, under the dom0
 policy. Install it only in the template of the GUI domains.
